   sosiyete, guhezwa kwa bamwe, ubusumbane n'amakimbirane. Gusa na none,
   imishinga y'isubiranyamwimerere ishobora kuba urubuga binyuze nko mu
   nama z'imishinga itera ibiti, irwanya isuri, amatsinda y'abahinzi
   bagenerwabikorwa b'iyi mishinga, amatsinda yo kubitsa no kugurizanya,
   ingendoshuri, umuganda, inteko z'abaturage n'umugoroba w'umuryango,
   byose bishyigikira mu buryo bumwe cyangwa ubundi imishinga
   y'isubiranyamwimerere no gukomeza kubaka sosiyete yunze ubumwe. Twasanze
   kandi hari amahirwe izi mishanga itanga nayo agira uruhare mu kubaka
   sosiyete yunze ubumwe, nko kubaka ubushobozi b'abagenerwabikorwa,
   gahunda za leta zitera ingabo mu bitugu ishyirwa mu bikorwa
   ry'isubiranyamwimerere, abafatanyabikorwa, abunzi, abamamazabuhinzi,
   urubyiruko rw'abakorerabushake, amahirwe angana ku mutungo w'igihugu
   byose bigira uruhare mu gutuma gahunda y'isubiranyamwimerere ishoboka
   ndetse no kubaka sosiyete yunze ubumwe. Tugendeye kubyo ubu
   bushakashatsi bwagaragaje, mu bihugu byanyuze mu makimbirane
   n'intambara, sosiyete yunze ubumwe ntigomba kumvikana gusa mu mboni
