Author = {Lyszkiewicz, Marcin and Zietara, Natalia and Frey, Laura and Pannicke,
   Ulrich and Stern, Marcel and Liu, Yanshan and Fan, Yanxin and Puchalka,
   Jacek and Hollizeck, Sebastian and Somekh, Ido and Rohlfs, Meino and
   Yilmaz, Tugba and Unal, Ekrem and Karakukcu, Musa and Patiroglu, Turkan
